    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hordes of cordel (folklore) legends in visceral Hack-and-Slash combat. A colonel's farmland is your battlefield. Defend it or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Create builds with devastating powers and upgrades. Turn your enemies' strength into your own weapon and break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural Sert\u00e3o sculpted in a 2.5D woodcut art style. No two paths are the same. Uncover the dark secrets this land hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOAQUIM'S BURDEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joaquim just wanted one last chance. Now, his fate is tied to a cursed land and the myths that dwell within. His survival is his only burden.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hordes of cordel (folklore) legends in visceral Hack-and-Slash combat. A colonel's farmland is your battlefield. Defend it or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Create builds with devastating powers and upgrades. Turn your enemies' strength into your own weapon and break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural Sert\u00e3o sculpted in a 2.5D woodcut art style. No two paths are the same. Uncover the dark secrets this land hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOAQUIM'S BURDEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joaquim just wanted one last chance. Now, his fate is tied to a cursed land and the myths that dwell within. His survival is his only burden.</p>",
    "short_description": "Face the legends of Cordel (Brazilian folklore) in an intense, top-down Action Roguelite. In a mystical land brought to life by a unique 2.5D woodcut art style, you'll need to master visceral Hack-and-Slash combat to survive waves of enemies and unveil the dark secrets that haunt these lands.",
